Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.15,0:00:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}甩不掉背上的泼猴吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Can't get the monkey off your back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.07,0:00:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那就放进嘴里吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Then put it in your mouth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.54,0:00:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}美味的金猴啤酒{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...with Monkeyshine Beer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.92,0:00:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哇噢{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.75,0:00:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}金猴啤酒{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Monkeyshine Beer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.30,0:00:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}外面就是宽广的丛林{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Because it's a jungle out there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}每次看到这个广告我就难过{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That commercial always makes me so sad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.64,0:00:35.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}可是那个男的一打开啤酒  女人就对他投怀送抱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, but then the guy opens his beer and girls run at him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.10,0:00:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}结局很棒啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...so everything works out okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:41.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我的意思是  那只猴子让我想到马塞尔{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I meant because the monkey in it reminds me of Marcel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.73,0:00:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我了解{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I can see that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.06,0:00:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}因为他们都有棕色眼睛跟翘下巴{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Because they both have those big brown eyes and the little pouty chin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.99,0:00:50.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}而且他们都是猴子{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And the fact that they're both monkeys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.45,0:00:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}有时我会想把他送走是对的吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I wonder if I did the right thing, giving him away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.33,0:00:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}罗斯  你只能这样做  他看到什么就跳上去{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ross, you had to. He was humping everything in sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.83,0:01:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}害我的马里布芭比娃娃  不能穿着白纱参加婚礼了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I mean, I have a Malibu Barbie who will no longer be wearing white to her wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.29,0:01:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}还记得他会把你们的帽子借走{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Remember when he'd borrow your hat...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.76,0:01:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}拿回来之后  上面都是小小猴子“葡萄干”大便吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and when you got it back, there'd be little monkey raisins in it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.22,0:01:15.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他那样做很好玩  我对我老板那样做的时候…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}When he did it, it was funny. When I did it to my boss's hat...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.22,0:01:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}却被老板责怪我态度不佳{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All of a sudden, I had this big "attitude problem."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.98,0:01:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}《老友记》 第二季 第12集: 超级杯之后（上集）{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Friends S02E12: The One After the Superbowl (A){\r}
