Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.90,0:02:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嘿…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.15,0:02:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们猜猜看我拿着什么  韵律{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Check it out! Guess what I got?  Rhythm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.86,0:02:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不是  是第一封影迷来信啦{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No. My first fan mail!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}来看看{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.91,0:02:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}〝亲爱的雷莫瑞医生{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}"Dear Dr. Ramoray:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.79,0:02:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}要知道我爱你  我愿不惜一切得到你〞{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Know that I love you and would do anything to have you."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.12,0:02:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}天啊 〝你的公开崇拜者  艾瑞卡福特〞{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}My gosh! "Your not-so-secret admirer, Erika Ford."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.21,0:02:25.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（制片：塔德·史帝文斯）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.96,0:02:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（制片：贝西·伯恩斯）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.71,0:02:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}等等{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.05,0:02:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}〝附注  请收下我送的14根睫毛〞{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}"P.S. Enclosed, please find 14 of my eyelashes."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.71,0:02:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（编剧：杰佛瑞·艾斯多夫 麦克西·考维兹）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.93,0:02:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你知道  在疯子的世界里  那就表示你结婚了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know, in Crazy World, that means you're married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.97,0:02:36.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（导演：麦可·连贝克）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.60,0:02:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这封信不是寄到《我们的日子》剧组  收信地址是你家{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's not addressed to Days Of Our Lives. This came to your apartment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.19,0:02:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}上面没有邮戳  她就藏身在我们大楼里{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}There's no stamp on it. This woman was in our building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.98,0:02:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.15,0:02:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我竟然有自己的跟踪者了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I got my very own stalker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.61,0:02:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嘿  嘿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, guys. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.99,0:02:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嘿  噢{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey. Ooh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.49,0:02:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你要去哪里{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Where are you off to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.74,0:03:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我要去参加洛杉矶的  古生物学研讨会{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}There's this paleontology conference in L.A.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.66,0:03:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我想顺便去动物园给马塞尔惊喜{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So I figured I'd go and drive down to the zoo and surprise Marcel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.91,0:03:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我想他会很惊喜的  直到发现他自己是只猴子{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I think he will be surprised. Till he realizes he's a monkey...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}还有  你知道  它根本就没办法有那种情绪{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and, uh, you know, isn't capable of that emotion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.26,0:03:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}菲比  那个帅哥又来了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, Phoebe? That really cute guy is here again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哦  噢{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh? Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.89,0:03:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}喔  各位…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, so everyone, ahem...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.26,0:03:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}请假装我在跟你们说故事  而且是很好笑的故事{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...pretend I'm telling you a story and it's really funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.81,0:03:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}大家快笑啊  快{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So everyone just laugh. Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我知道  对啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I know, I know! Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.81,0:03:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哈罗  嗨{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hello.  Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.23,0:03:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}噢{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.82,0:03:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我是罗伯·杜南{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm Rob Donan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.15,0:03:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嗨  罗伯·杜南{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hi, Rob Donan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.45,0:03:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我对音乐一窍不通  不过我觉得你非常棒{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I don't know anything about music, but I think you're really great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}喔  哇{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, wow. Ha, ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.74,0:03:47.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我在替儿童图书馆安排艺人表演{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Anyway, I schedule performers for children's libraries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.71,0:03:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我在想  你有没有考虑过为孩子们演唱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And I was thinking, have you thought about playing your songs for kids?{\r}
